The main new result is an exact formula expressing \(E_0(2L)-2E_0(L)\) as half an integrated susceptibility between two distant bond reconnections. Bounding that response by \(O(M\log d/L)\) would prove the conjecture. I identified the required constant, but did not derive the response bound from locality.

